TITLE 1D transport 10 cells, 10 shifts, exchange 0.001 mol sites/cell

SOLUTION 1
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0

SOLUTION 0
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0

SOLUTION 2-10
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0

EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001

TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -lengths 1
    -dispersivities 0
    -time_step 1
    -diffusion_coefficient 0
    -punch_cells 1

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file sel.csv
    -reset false
    -high_precision true

USER_PUNCH
    -headings step viscosity
10 PUNCH STEP_NO, VISC

END
